hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17663","Hasan narrated to us: Ibn Lahi'ah narrated to us, who said: Yazid ibn Abi Habib narrated to us, from Kharashah ibn al-Harith, and he was among the companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), who said: None of you should witness a slain person, lest he was killed unjustly and wrath befall him."
